"Please try again." = "请重试。";
"Finds names, companies, and addresses on every kind of contract we tested, and it is the only setting that runs on a 16 GB Mac. On two full agreements, one English and one Chinese, it found 35 of the 36 names, companies, and addresses that had to be caught. It is the least precise of the three: about one flag in five is something you will look at and dismiss, so reviewing takes longer than waiting does." = "在我们测试的各类合同中，它都能找出姓名、公司和地址，而且这是唯一能在配备 16 GB 内存的 Mac 上运行的设置。在两份完整协议中，一份为英文，另一份为中文，它找出了必须识别的 36 个姓名、公司和地址中的 35 个。它是三个设置中精确度最低的：大约每五个标记中就有一个会被你查看后排除，因此审核所花的时间比等待结果更长。";
"The best all round choice when your Mac has the memory. It also found 35 of 36, and it is by far the tidiest to review: only about one flag in fifteen is something you will dismiss. It reports what it finds in exactly the wording of your document, so nothing is lost between finding a name and redacting it. The one it missed was a Chinese bank branch name, so on Chinese documents prefer Most thorough when the document matters." = "如果你的 Mac 内存足够，这是整体表现最好的选择。它同样找出了 36 个中的 35 个，而且审核起来最省心：大约每十五个标记中只有一个会被排除。它会完全按照文档中的原文呈现识别结果，因此从发现姓名到将其脱敏之间不会丢失任何信息。唯一漏掉的是一家中国银行分行的名称。因此，对于重要的中文文档，请优先选择最彻底。";
"The only setting that missed nothing. On the same two agreements it found all 36 names, companies, and addresses, including the ones Quick and Balanced each missed. You pay for that twice: it takes about twice as long as Balanced, and it flags more that you will dismiss, roughly one in eight. Choose it for the document you cannot afford to get wrong." = "这是唯一没有漏掉任何内容的设置。在同样的两份协议中，它找出了全部 36 个姓名、公司和地址，包括快速和均衡各自漏掉的内容。代价有两方面：所需时间约为均衡的两倍，而且会标记更多最终被你排除的内容，大约每八个中有一个。对于绝不能出错的文档，请选择此设置。";
