"These cannot be corrected here. A placeholder that is missing from the mapping or damaged by editing is not a recorded value, and a masked form several entities share has no single owner. Settle those by hand in the saved document." = "这些内容无法在此更正。映射中缺失或在编辑时受损的占位符并不是已记录的值；由多项信息共用的遮盖形式也没有唯一归属。请在存储后的文档中手动处理这些位置。";
