"Plain text" = "纯文本";
"Word document" = "Word 文档";
"Original format" = "原格式";
"One Markdown file with the body text, as Export for AI writes it. Headers, footers, notes and comments are left out." = "一个 Markdown 文件，只含正文，与“导出给 AI”的写法相同。页眉、页脚、脚注和批注不包括在内。";
