"The same kind of text file, line for line." = "同类型的文本文件，逐行对应。";
"Batch output format" = "批量脱敏的输出格式";
"Batch Anonymize writes one Markdown file per document." = "批量脱敏为每个文档写出一个 Markdown 文件。";
"Batch Anonymize writes each document in its own format: Word keeps its formatting, text keeps its lines, and a PDF or an image keeps its pages with every value covered and its redacted text beside it." = "批量脱敏按每个文档的原格式写出：Word 保留排版，文本保留行结构，PDF 和图像保留页面、遮盖每个值，并在旁边另存脱敏文本。";
"Output format: %@. Change it in Settings > General." = "输出格式：%@。可在“设置 > 通用”中更改。";
"Redacted PDF: %@  ·  boxes are permanent, not restorable" = "已脱敏 PDF：%@  ·  框选是永久的，无法恢复";
"Values that could not be found on the page to cover: %lld. A copy in the original format would still show them, so nothing was saved. Choose Markdown for this document." = "页面上找不到位置加以遮盖的值：%lld 个。原格式的副本仍会显示它们，因此没有保存任何文件。请为此文档选择 Markdown。";
"The PDF shows text the review did not read, such as a scanned page, so a copy in the original format would show it unredacted. Nothing was saved. Choose Markdown for this document: it holds only the reviewed text." = "这个 PDF 含有审阅时没有读到的文字（例如扫描页），原格式的副本会把这些文字原样显示出来，因此没有保存任何文件。请为此文档选择 Markdown：它只包含审阅过的文字。";
"Choose Where to Save…" = "选择存储位置…";
"Where the mapping is kept" = "映射保存在哪里";
"LDA keeps this document's mapping in a workspace on this Mac, named after the document. Restore finds it there, so the redacted document you send carries no key beside it." = "LDA 会把本文档的映射保存在这台 Mac 上的一个工作区中，并以该文档命名。还原会在那里找到它，因此你发出的已脱敏文档旁边不带任何密钥。";
"Also save a mapping file next to the redacted document" = "同时在已脱敏文档旁保存一个还原对照文件";
"Only this file can restore the document on another Mac. Send it to someone who should be able to, and give them the passphrase separately." = "只有该文件才能在另一台 Mac 上还原本文档。请只发给应当能够还原它的人，并另行告知密码。";
