"Choose or drop the file that came back: the Markdown you exported for the AI, or a redacted Word document you saved. The mapping is found automatically from this session, from the workspace LDA keeps for the document, or from a .ldamap saved next to the file. Formatting is kept when the file is a Word document." = "选择或拖入返回的文件：你导出给 AI 的 Markdown，或你保存的已脱敏 Word 文档。映射会自动从本次会话、LDA 为该文档保存的工作区，或文件旁的 .ldamap 中找到。若文件是 Word 文档，格式将得到保留。";
