"Add several files to review them together. You can add more later." = "可一次添加多个文件，也能稍后继续添加。";
"Choose or drop a redacted Word, Markdown, or text file. Review the restored values before saving a new copy." = "选择或拖入去标识化的 Word、Markdown 或文本文件。先预览还原的信息，再保存新副本。";
