"Choose MCP Helper" = "选择连接组件";
"Choose an app, save its setup script, then open the script in Terminal. Setup is optional; you can return here from Settings at any time." = "选择你使用的 AI 软件，保存设置脚本，再用“终端”打开该文件。完成后重启 AI 软件。以后也可以从“设置”回到这里。";
"Configuration copied." = "已复制配置。";
"Copy Configuration" = "复制配置";
